'''Lodestar''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Biotsavartian]]<ref name="Ragnarok">[[Ragnarok]]</ref><ref name="Vendetta">''[[Vendetta]]''</ref>{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/38/AF_Mini_Bible.pdf Alien Force Series Mini Bible]|group = AF Mini Bible|name = biot}}{{Refn|Lodestar's species was revealed in ''[[Vendetta]]'' as "Biotsavartian",{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/8/84/Vendetta_Script_Third_Draft.pdf ''Vendetta'' Script Third Draft]|group = script|name = script}}<ref name="Vendetta"/> which aired on March 6, 2010 internationally. That same day, an anonymous user edited Lodestar's page to add "Biosovartian" as Lodestar's species, and later changed it to "Biosovortian". The species' page was created with that name on March 15, 2010 by another anonymous user. On March 30, 2011, [[User:TheRealBenvictor97|TheRealBenvictor97]] renamed the species' page to "Biotsavartian", citing [[Dwayne McDuffie]]. The same user changed the species' name on Lodestar's page to "Biotsavartian" on March 31, 2011. These two edits were later reverted by [[User:Orion Invictus|Orion Invictus]] on April 20, 2011 and by [[User:BlazeCannon15|BlazeCannon15]] on April 2, 2011, and the misspelling of the name remained on the wiki until August 16, 2021. In that time, "Biosovortian" was listed as Lodestar's species in an issue of the official '''Ben 10''' magazine.{{Refn|'''Ben 10''' magazine; [[:File:Biosovortian Spelling.png|file]]|group = mag}}{{Refn|[[Ben 10 Planet:Longstanding Misinformation]]|group = BTP}}|group = note}} from the planet [[Maxwell]].{{Refn|group = AF Mini Bible|name = biot}}

==Appearance==
Lodestar has a magnetically floating metal head surrounded by a glowing white aura and levitates in an arch between his shoulders. He has crab-like claws for hands (similar to [[Brainstorm]]'s) and his body is mainly brownish-black with yellow feet, hands, shoulders, and chest. His body is also made of living alien metal.{{Refn|[[:File:Lodestar's Body.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', looked mostly the same, except the yellow parts of Lodestar's body are slightly darker.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Lodestar has a yellow eyebrow-like crest on his forehead, which looks similar to that of [[Jetray (Classic)|Jetray]]. His head is more skull-shaped with has lines beneath his mouth. The glowing aura around his head is recolored green, the yellow from his feet go up to his thighs, his shoulders are now larger, and the yellow stripes by his chest are shorter.

Lodestar wears the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]]/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]]/[[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his chest.

